# Scheme Installation 

## Integrate in VS Code

* Main menu->Terminal->Configure tasks
* Create new task:
~~~ {.code}
    {
      // See https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=733558
      // for the documentation about the tasks.json format
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "tasks": [
        {
            "label": "run scheme",
            "type": "shell",
            "command": "scheme",
            "args": ["<", "${file}"]

        }
      ]
    }
~~~